{"strongs": "H8300", "word": "שָׂרִיד", "translit": "sa.rid", "root": "שריד", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "survivor", "definition": "I. שָׂרִיד noun masculine Jer 47:4 survivor (from a defeat, etc.); — absolute ׳ שׂ Isa 1:9 +; suffix שְׂרִידוֺ Job 27:15 Kt ; plural שְׂרִידִים Josh 10:20 ; Joel 3:5 construct שְׂרִידֵי Jer 31:2 suffix שְׂרִידָיו Obad 1:14 + Job 27:15 Qr ( van d. H. also Kt ); — 1. survivor (often || פָּלִיט ): especially ׳ עַד בִּלְתִּי הִשְׁאִיר לוֺ שׂ Num 21:35 ; Josh 8:22 (both J E ), Deut 3:3 ; Josh 10:33 ; Josh 11:8 ; 2Kgs 10:11 (all D ); more simply, ׳ שׂ ׳ לֹא הִשׁ Deut 2:34 ; Josh 10:28 ; Josh 10:30 ; Josh 10:37 ; Josh 10:39 ; Josh 10:40 (all D ); ׳ הוֺתִיר לָנוּ שׂ ׳ י Isa 1:9 לֹא יִהְיֶה לְ ׳ שׂ Jer 42:17 ; Jer 44:14 ; Obad 1:18 ׳ אֵין שׂ Job 18:19 וְהֶאֱבִיד מֵעִיר ׳ שׂ Num 24:19 ( J E ); עַם שְׂרִידֵי חָ֑רֶב Jer 31:2 , plural also Josh 10:20 (subject of שָֽׂרְדוּ ), Joel 3:5 ; Obad 1:14 ; Job 27:15 (see above); singular also Judg 5:13 (obscure, for לְ ׳ שׂ read perhaps יִשְׂרָאֵל GFM Now compare Bu ), Jer 47:4 ; Lam 2:22 . 2. of things: לְאָכְלוֺ ׳ אֵין שׂ Job 20:21 , i.e. nothing has escaped his greed; בְּאָהֳלוֺ ׳ (אֵשׁ) יֵ֫רַע שׂ v Job 20:26 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8311')\">BDB8311</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H8300')\">H8300</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8310')\">BDB8310</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8312')\">BDB8312</entry></div><p> I. <bdbheb>שָׂרִיד</bdbheb> <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Jer 47:4\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"47\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"47\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(24,47,4)\">Jer 47:4</ref></sup> <highlightword>survivor</highlightword> (from a defeat, etc.); — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׂ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 1:9\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(23,1,9)\">Isa 1:9</ref> +; suffix <bdbheb>שְׂרִידוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 27:15\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"27\" vBeg